# Dave — project context

At the start of substantive work on this repo (or when Dave says "continue" / "pick up"):

1. Read `docs/personal.md` — pace, Linux Mint, baby steps, no unsolicited commits.
2. Read `docs/SESSION_HANDOFF.md` — what was done last and what to do next.
3. Skim `docs/PRODUCT_CONTINUITY.md` for architecture.

Flutter app lives in `~/development/mygigguide_app` (separate repo). **Default dev/test:** `./scripts/build_apk.sh mygigguide`. **Rogues** at major milestones: `./scripts/build_apk.sh rogues` (`BRAND=rogues`). Launcher icons: `flutter_launcher_icons-<flavor>.yaml`, then `dart run flutter_launcher_icons`.

Explain commands in plain language; one step at a time unless Dave asks for a batch.
